{"c":[{"name":"20261003T155327Z-d8b7c9de6967162d","text":"Debug-socket 'inject helperLine' takes the helper-socket route, gate included (A12): an injected action is a helper offer whose Tab sends offerAccept. Scripts that inject must pass their own --settings, or a paused or Fill-off user file refuses it.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T182128Z-e49f48ead18a928c","text":"Grammarly Desktop (UIElement agent) keeps a layer-1 alpha-1 window at the focused field grown 64 pt per side; SurfaceGate skips such agent rings via the live focused frame (ringsField), or every TextEdit offer is held 'covered' (A12).","type":"note"}]}
